{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>警方因應深圳APEC第33次領導人非正式會議而設禁飛區。警方今凌晨（19日）約12時在天水圍拘捕一名20歲本地男子，涉嫌「未經許可在限制飛行區以內飛行」及「操作期間違反操作規定」。警員在行動中檢獲一部小型無人機，被捕人現正被扣留調查。案件交由元朗警區刑事調查隊跟進。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:12:32.438273+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:53:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T04:37:27.390180+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:06:08.287089+00:00","content_hash":"e70aa37002f07b39490c2df4730690e53590827ad3581b7a892c2c3fa903f424","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}